{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Self-Contained .NET Deployment.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Self-Contained .NET Deployment.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"self contained .net deployment self contained .net deployment","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Self-Contained .NET Deployment.md","fileName":"Self-Contained .NET Deployment.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Self-Contained .NET Deployment","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-08 21:16\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[.NET Assemblies Packages and Deployment]]","tags":["baby"],"links":[".NET Assemblies Packages and Deployment","c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Self-Contained .NET Deployment.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Self-Contained .NET Deployment.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"self contained .net deployment self contained .net deployment","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Self-Contained .NET Deployment.md","fileName":"Self-Contained .NET Deployment.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Self-Contained .NET Deployment","heading":"Self-Contained .NET Deployment","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A self-contained .NET deployment includes the application, its dependencies, and the runtime required to execute it. The target does not need a separately installed compatible runtime, making the published bundle more predictable and portable to the selected platform.\n\nThat independence increases output size and requires a runtime identifier for the intended operating system and architecture. Separate bundles may be needed for different targets, and the application owner carries responsibility for updating the included runtime.","tags":["baby"],"links":[".NET Assemblies Packages and Deployment","c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformde